  "body": "Too Sweet to Miss - Final Weekend Before Auction!\r\n\r\nTwo beautiful spaces, one sought-after coastal address, and a little extra sweetness in the mix.\r\n\r\nA legal home and income in beautiful Red Beach? Now that's something special.\r\n\r\nLike a perfectly crafted macaron, this property brings together quality, thoughtful detail and plenty of appeal. Combining a beautifully appointed main residence with a private, self-contained minor dwelling, it offers a rare blend of premium family living, flexibility and exciting income potential.\r\n\r\nThe main residence is designed to impress with three spacious bedrooms plus a study, 2.5 bathrooms including an ensuite in the master, and generous storage, giving you room to grow, work from home and enjoy life in comfort. High-spec finishes and carefully considered details create a home that feels polished yet welcoming, with central heating adds a welcome touch of comfort.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen is a real treat, featuring premium Fisher & Paykel appliances and stylish Australian tiles that bring a distinctive finish to the space. At the heart of the home, open-plan living and dining create an inviting setting for family time and entertaining, flowing seamlessly onto the open deck. Picture summer barbecues, relaxed evenings and friends gathering while the fresh coastal air does its thing.\r\n\r\nComfort comes naturally here too. The bathrooms with underfloor heating bring their European flair, with Italian and Spanish tiles, adding texture and character to these everyday spaces. An oversized double garage with polished concrete flooring delivers both practicality and contemporary style.\r\n\r\nAnd here's where things get even sweeter.\r\n\r\nThe minor dwelling offers its own private entrance, self-contained living environment with high standard features. A spacious and light-filled living room seamlessly connects with an elegant designed kitchen and a well-appointed laundry area. The open-plan layout creates a sense of space and flow, offering the perfect blend of style, comfort, and practicality. Two double bedrooms share a full bathroom, with comfortable decks and outdoor space to relax, unwind, and enjoy the fresh air. \r\n\r\nTwo homes, one title, featuring separate water meters, electricity, and gas meters. Each living space enjoys complete independence and privacy. Ideal for rental income, Airbnb hosting, or extended families seeking separate arrangements under one roof.\r\n\r\nSet in sought-after Red Beach, this is more than just a beautiful place to call home. It's an opportunity to enjoy a premium coastal lifestyle while keeping your options open for the future.\r\n\r\nCome and discover the sweet life at 19 Surfview Crescent, Red Beach.",
